{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Uttra: Offline Dictation 是一款為 Mac 而設的語音聽寫工具，把說話直接轉成乾淨文字，整個過程在本機離線完成。適合希望減少打字的人，對於無法舒適使用鍵盤，或長時間打字感到緩慢、吃力與疲倦的用家尤其有幫助。原價 US $6.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-Smac01-75.webp\">\n<h2>離線聽寫本機完成</h2>\n<p>Uttra 內建 Parakeet TDT v3 語音模型，安裝後無須下載即可完全離線運作，亦可按需要加裝 Whisper 模型。按住 Option 加空白鍵說話，放開即完成聽寫，並自動加上標點、大小寫與空格，同時移除口頭贅字與重複詞句。可把語言、清理方式與快捷鍵存成 Voice Mode，亦可自訂詞彙表，記下名字、品牌與術語的正確寫法。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-6-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-7-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-8-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-9-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-10-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2880x1800bb-11-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Uttra: Offline Dictation</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:29.978391+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T21:35:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T11:18:15.751037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T21:37:46.099394+00:00","content_hash":"02f4a88cc6c01e820bcf0b59d703f567ce35ba73a4a683c46089f6512f44430d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}